Ahoy!

All pirates, rejoice! We have rolled out a massive update with a tournament mode, gamepad support and plenty of tweaks and bug fixes.

Please check out the full change log below.

http://i.imgur.com/DKXZCGA.jpg

http://i.imgur.com/nS8R0t1.jpg

What's new:

New version - v1.0.92;
Added gamepad support;
Added PvP tournament mode for ten players plus spectators;
Added lootable chests for boarding scenes;
Crew members can now be seen onboard in first person view mode;
Lightening effects can now be turned off - some players reported them to be way too uncomfortable to see;
Non-quest encounters are now 15-20% rarer to happen on the global map;
Captured ships no loger fire with their stern guns and chasers;
Morale drops decreased on Hard;
50% more money on Easy, 25% more on Normal;
Monsters armor decreased on high levels;
Plenty of bug and text fixes;


Also, another sneak peek for you!

http://i.imgur.com/NV67dc9.jpg

Good hunting and stay tuned!
ːjrogerː

