Ahoy!

Patch 1.0.8 has arrived, looking forward to your feedback!

What's new:

Successful boarding now allows you to take enemy vessels as a prize;
Trading bonuses and discounts were reduced;
List of all trading goods is now available via captain's log;
Numerous bug fixes.

Good hunting.

