Ahoy!

We have been busy last week and rolled out two patches. More to come!

What's new:

1.0.2

Steam used to damage save files - fixed;
Added notifications about new players joining in multiplayer;
A significant nerf of healing and mana-restoring ammo;
A deck is now much better detailed in third person mode;
Artifact of Speed is now less effective;
Artifacts' activations now cost more energy;
 Fixed several Leviathan glitches.

1.0.3

Enemy's boarding party deals less damage now;
Enemy's boarding party has 50% less defence now;
Players's boarding party deals more damage now;
Overall duration of boarding is much less now;
A ton of tweaking and bug fixes in tutorial, quests and multiplayer.


Good hunting!

