Fixed camera glitch during boarding sequence;
Fixed deck's loss of graphics after the player leaves tutorial mode;
Translation fixes in tutorial;
Exiting game during the death of the ship caused major bugs: fixed;
Fixed damaged save files;
Second stage of'The Black Beard' quest is fixed - now all boarded ships gets in count;
Time window between encounters on global and tactical maps is now bigger;
The Kraken's ːtentacː quest is fixed.


Good hunting.

