Ahoy! Second major update has arrived from beta, third one is coming soon featuring new quests and content. Enjoy the wind and stay tuned!

What's new: 

- WIND. It has it's physics now and it affects speed. - 40% upwind and +10% downwind. Watch flags and waves to see it's direction; 

- Enemies are more different now. Some ships are vulnerable to boarding, some have weak rigging etc. use spyglass to find their weakspots. Ignoring that may turn into wasting a double amount of ordinary cannonballs; 

- Due to the new balance loot is better by 35% on Normal difficulty; 

- Better crew managment UI. Hiring, promotions and healing via buttons instead of dragging; 

- Difficulty now determines an amount of loot instead enemies' HP; 

- You start with 700 coins again; 

- Sunken ships' collision is back and improved; 

- You can now bribe guards to enter settlments where you have low rep; 

- Dead and wounded system works properly now; 

- Flamethrower requres x2 energy to use; 

- Turning speed now depends on sailing speed; 

- Better chances for a succesful matchmaking; 

- Plenty of minor balancing tweaks, bug fixes, improvements. 


Good hunting!ːboardingː

