What's new: 

- reloading color is blue now instead of red; 
- fixed critical bug of crew dying without obvious reasons; 
- AI's pathfinding improved; 
- sunken ships don't collide anymore thus deal no damage; 
- if player leaves multiplayer match, AI takes control over the ship - you can sink and plunder her as usual; 
- several multiplayer tweaks incl. spyglass and time acceleration; 
- fullscreen button is now working properly; 
- added an option to limit cursor within game window. 

Good hunting!

